{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791297622730,"sessionID":"ses_eee579689ffeJU8gbL0Rxwz4Mq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a111a890bc70b2b5fa6136","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/dsflash-max__routing__r2__1791297611/work/answers.json","content":"[\n {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/dsflash-max__routing__r2__1791297611/work/answers.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/dsflash-max__routing__r2__1791297611/work/answers.json","time":{"start":1791297622717,"end":1791297622721}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me work through each request carefully.\n\nModels table:\n- atlas-pro: Northwind, cli nw, lanes implement/review/research, floor high, ceiling max\n- atlas-lite: Northwind, cli nw, lanes extract/prose, floor low, ceiling high\n- corvid-9: Corvid, cli cv, lanes implement/review, floor medium, ceiling max\n- corvid-mini: Corvid, cli cv, lanes extract, floor low, ceiling medium\n- pellet-2: Pellet, cli pl, lanes prose/research, floor medium, ceiling high\n\nLane order (first eligible wins):\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n\nRules:\nR1: eligibility requires lane in model's lanes.\nR2: review lane — model family must differ from request author_family.\nR3: pinned CLI — only models on that cli.\nR4: skip unavailable models.\nR5: no eligible → Unrouted, effort null.\nR6: effort clamp to [floor, ceiling].\n\nq1: implement, effort medium.\n- atlas-pro: eligible lane, no pins, available. Floor high, ceiling max. Requested medium < floor → floor = high. So model atlas-pro, effort high.\n\nq2: review, effort high, author_family Corvid.\n- corvid-9: lane review ok, but family Corvid == author Corvid → R2 excludes.\n- next atlas-pro: review lane ok, family Northwind ≠ Corvid → eligible. Floor high, ceiling max; requested high ≥ floor, ≤ ceiling → keep high. Model atlas-pro, effort high.\n\nq3: extract, effort low, pinned_cli pl.\n- extract lane order: corvid-mini (cli cv) — excluded by R3 (cli not pl). atlas-lite (cli nw) — excluded. pellet-2: cli pl, but lanes prose/research — does not include extract → R1 excludes. No eligible → Unrouted, effort null.\n\nq4: prose, effort max, unavailable [pellet-2].\n- prose order: pellet-2 — unavailable → skip. atlas-lite: prose lane ok, cli nw, available. Floor low, ceiling high; requested max > ceiling → ceiling high. Model atlas-lite, effort high.\n\nq5: extract, effort max.\n- extract order: corvid-mini (available, lane ok). Floor low, ceiling medium; max > ceiling → medium. Model corvid-mini, effort medium.\n\nq6: research, effort high, pinned_cli pl.\n- research order: atlas-pro (cli nw) — excluded by R3. pellet-2: cli pl, lanes prose/research includes research → eligible. Floor medium, ceiling high; requested high ≤ ceiling → keep high. Model pellet-2, effort high.\n\nAnswers:\nq1: atlas-pro, high\nq2: atlas-pro, high\nq3: Unrouted, null\nq4: atlas-lite, high\nq5: corvid-mini, medium\nq6: pellet-2, high\n\nWrite answers.json.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_111a8908f001ifqkSao8y4nzqy","sessionID":"ses_eee579689ffeJU8gbL0Rxwz4Mq","messageID":"msg_111a88769001FlyoYg5apFofCi"}}
